#: 6e51ecb8be014869bc8d78fa8b8c20ce
msgid ""
"Start from HOLD, then HOME, then MOVEJ / OCS2 as the **running** "
"controller allows ([FSM and "
"Topics](../../../3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md)). `/fsm_command` is "
"`std_msgs/Int32` (not strings such as `stand` / `walk`)."
msgstr ""
"从 HOLD 开始，再 HOME，再按**正在运行的**控制器允许的范围进入 MOVEJ / "
"OCS2（[状态机与话题](../../../3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md)）。`/fsm_command` 是 "
"`std_msgs/Int32`（不是 `stand` / `walk` 这类字符串）。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/0-index.md:117
