#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/0-index.md:119
#: 8afdea81f32248c3ab17164388c1074d
msgid ""
"Use the matching **branch** and its README scripts. `demo.launch.py "
"robot:=arx_acone` is Acone (dual-arm), not Lift 2S. The HighTorque launch"
" key is `panthera_ht`."
msgstr ""
"使用对应 **分支** 及其 README 脚本。`demo.launch.py robot:=arx_acone` 是 Acone（双臂），不是"
" Lift 2S。高擎的 launch 名是 `panthera_ht`。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/0-index.md:121
#: c59e7ebdd5234279970e16fda838aa39
msgid ""
"**[ARX Lift 2S](1-arx_lift2s.md)** — `git clone -b arx-lift2s …` then "
"`./init_repo.sh` and `./quick_start.sh`. Full-body including chassis."
msgstr ""
"**[方舟无限 Lift 2S](1-arx_lift2s.md)** — `git clone -b arx-lift2s …` 然后 "
"`./init_repo.sh` 和 `./quick_start.sh`。全身含底盘。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/0-index.md:122
#: f0b2e7a3cb80480197ea87092e6cd7d0
msgid ""
"**Acone** / **AC One** — **dual-arm**; pick ACone in that same "
"`quick_start` menu for co-debug."
msgstr "**Acone** / **AC One** — **双臂**；在同一 `quick_start` 菜单中选 ACone 做联调。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/0-index.md:123
#: a706d1113aee45dda27472e414426c3a
msgid ""
"**[HighTorque Panthera HT](2-panthera_ht.md)** — `git clone -b panthera-"
"ht …` then `./init_repo.sh` / `./release.sh --install` and "
"`./quick_start.sh`. Isomorphic teleop: `./teleop_start.sh`."
msgstr ""
"**[高擎 Panthera HT](2-panthera_ht.md)** — `git clone -b panthera-ht …` 然后 "
"`./init_repo.sh` / `./release.sh --install` 和 "
"`./quick_start.sh`。同构遥操作：`./teleop_start.sh`。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/0-index.md:125
